// Changes to the instance ct code in the editor (§7.4): after editing, the VM re-elaborates -
// rolling back all changes and the parsing program in canonical order - and the changed node
// is shown as changed. The editing of the call location (instance argument) changes the
// result; the source is no longer a ct code - there is no change.
//  
// 
//.
// program: editor_ct_inst.tz
open_view module
// expect: print("вход");⏎  print("тело");
// editing of the call location: "entry" → "entry" - instance other, the result of another
pointer 1 @вход:2 0 5
key 1 ы
// expect: курсор:   instrument(code(greet), "входы‸");
// elaboration
idle
// expect: print("входы");⏎  print("тело");
// Source is no longer ct code (ct → xct): no change
pointer 1 @ct:1 0 0
key 1 x
// expect-not: print("входы");⏎  print("тело");
// again ct - the change is back
key 1 Backspace
idle
// expect: print("входы");⏎  print("тело");
